249
00:21:13,814 --> 00:21:15,565
Reform.

250
00:21:15,649 --> 00:21:17,067
-Das tat weh.
-Komm schon.

251
00:21:17,818 --> 00:21:19,152
-Hey.
-Bitte.

252
00:21:19,236 --> 00:21:20,320
Wirf!

