-Hier!

256
00:21:29,621 --> 00:21:31,123
-Gut!
-Gut!

257
00:21:35,252 --> 00:21:36,336
Hey!

258
00:21:37,462 --> 00:21:38,463
Wirf!

259
00:21:40,257 --> 00:21:41,258
Ja!

260
00:21:43,135 --> 00:21:44,386
